!@descr: test-only code compiled into mlxf_test_exec: assertions, the suite registry, the toys that mirror SIMPLE (polarft_calc, its GPU workspace, eul_prob_tab; projector, its GPU workspace and the batch projector; reconstructor_pcg, its GPU workspace and the PCG engine), their oracles and benchmarks; the ABI probe of the generated layer (a C header and its echo functions, compiled by Apple's clang, and the tester)
